  "checkpointCrab": {
    "_comment": "A Checkpoint Crab appears every `everyLevels` levels. Defeat it and that level is saved: after dying you swim again from it (instead of from level 1). Its strength is set from yours when it appears, so the fight is fair for every hero and perk: it takes about `hitsToDefeat` of your bites, and each pinch takes `pinchHpFraction` of your health and stuns you briefly. It stays around its spot (`homeWidth` x `homeHeight`) near the deepest water you may swim in, and chases you only within `guardRange`.",
    "everyLevels": 10,
    "sizeRatio": 1.15,
    "hitsToDefeat": 14,
    "pinchHpFraction": 0.12,
    "pinchStunSeconds": 0.7,
    "guardRange": 420,
    "homeWidth": 520,
    "homeHeight": 180,
    "spawnDistance": 700,
    "rewardLevels": 0.5
  },
  "tides": {
    "_comment": "A Tide is a chapter of `levelsPerTide` levels, ending with the Checkpoint Crab. Themes repeat as harder '+' versions after the list runs out. Each Tide from the 2nd on, reef fish spawn `aiLevelsPerTide` levels higher (up to `aiLevelBonusMax`). Legend levels (past the adult stage): strength x(1 + legendRankPerLevel) per level, and a perk every `legendPerkEvery` levels.",
    "levelsPerTide": 10,
    "aiLevelsPerTide": 1,
    "aiLevelBonusMax": 8,
